      {
         "id": "8c63a4e2-56c7-4d84-9d95-c683a4ad84b0",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "nerd",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "1adedc53-a246-49d1-aa42-cee0fd3aa553",
               "text": "Texto Original",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=class_content&arg=1adedc53-a246-49d1-aa42-cee0fd3aa553",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Separando en Órdenes\n\nAntes de restar, también necesitamos recordar otra característica de los números: todo número puede separarse en órdenes.\n\nEl número 12, por ejemplo, está formado por una decena y dos unidades, y puede escribirse así:\n\n12 = 10 + 2\n\nAquí, 10 es el valor del orden de las decenas y 2 es el valor del orden de las unidades.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "fd4fe060-1e86-4c87-a552-984d857b26a2",
         "prev": "a3c9ade2-8d8a-4578-bf8a-56495f76d739",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": null,
         "score": 1,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "fd4fe060-1e86-4c87-a552-984d857b26a2",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "inlove",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "1adedc53-a246-49d1-aa42-cee0fd3aa553",
               "text": "Texto Original",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=class_content&arg=1adedc53-a246-49d1-aa42-cee0fd3aa553",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Todo Junto\n\nAhora vamos a usar todo lo que recordamos para calcular 12 − 7. Esto significa que, de los 12 cuadrados de abajo, queremos quitar 7.\n\nPara representar esa retirada, vamos a cambiar el color de los cuadrados de azul claro a amarillo claro.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p class=\"desc\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 56\" width=\"100%\" style=\"max-width:760px; display:block; margin:0 auto;\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Doce cuadrados azul claro\"><title>Doce cuadrados azul claro que representan el número 12</title><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"lightblue\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"64\" y=\"0\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"lightblue\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"128\" y=\"0\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"lightblue\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"192\" y=\"0\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"lightblue\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"256\" y=\"0\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"lightblue\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"320\" y=\"0\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"lightblue\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"384\" y=\"0\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"lightblue\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"448\" y=\"0\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"lightblue\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"512\" y=\"0\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"lightblue\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"576\" y=\"0\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"lightblue\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"640\" y=\"0\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"lightblue\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"704\" y=\"0\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"lightblue\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg></p><p class=\"desc\"><b>Figura 2</b>: Los 12 cuadrados del número 12, antes de la resta.</p>",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "html",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
