      },
      {
         "id": "fd64c19f-90a5-48cc-8d89-39ed7f876319",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "happy",
         "source_menu": [
            {
               "type": 1,
               "uuid": "1adedc53-a246-49d1-aa42-cee0fd3aa553",
               "text": "Texto Original",
               "page": "https://www.historytracers.org/index.html?page=class_content&arg=1adedc53-a246-49d1-aa42-cee0fd3aa553",
               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### El Resultado\n\nAhora podemos terminar el cálculo:\n\n10 − 7 = 3\n2 + 3 = 5\n\nAsí, 12 − 7 = 5. En la figura de abajo, los siete cuadrados amarillos claros desvanecidos son los 7 que quitamos, y los cinco cuadrados azules claros son el resultado. Juntos siguen mostrando los 12 con los que empezamos.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            },
            {
               "text": "<p class=\"desc\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 760 56\" width=\"100%\" style=\"max-width:760px; display:block; margin:0 auto;\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Siete cuadrados amarillo claro desvanecidos y cinco cuadrados azul claro\"><title>Siete cuadrados amarillo claro desvanecidos y cinco cuadrados azul claro que representan el cálculo 12 menos 7 igual a 5</title><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"lightyellow\" fill-opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"64\" y=\"0\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"lightyellow\" fill-opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"128\" y=\"0\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"lightyellow\" fill-opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"192\" y=\"0\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"lightyellow\" fill-opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"256\" y=\"0\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"lightyellow\" fill-opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"320\" y=\"0\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"lightyellow\" fill-opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"384\" y=\"0\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"lightyellow\" fill-opacity=\"0.3\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"448\" y=\"0\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"lightblue\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"512\" y=\"0\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"lightblue\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"576\" y=\"0\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"lightblue\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"640\" y=\"0\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"lightblue\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"704\" y=\"0\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"lightblue\" stroke=\"#333333\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg></p><p class=\"desc\"><b>Figura 4</b>: Siete cuadrados amarillos claros desvanecidos (los 7 quitados) y cinco cuadrados azules claros (el resultado).</p>",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
